# Beastrider .gitignore
# Repository layout: godot/ (Godot 4 project), rust/ (gdext cdylib crate), .specify/ (Spec Kit).

# --- Rust ---
# Build output. Cargo.lock is committed on purpose: this crate is a final
# product, not a library, so builds must be reproducible.
rust/target/
# rustfmt backup files
**/*.rs.bk

# --- Godot 4 ---
# Editor cache and imported-asset cache; regenerated on open.
godot/.godot/
# Compiled Rust libraries copied into the project, if the .gdextension file
# points here instead of at rust/target/. Rebuilt by cargo, never hand-edited.
godot/bin/
# Exported game builds and export credentials.
godot/export/
build/
export_credentials.cfg
# Note: *.import files ARE committed in Godot 4; they hold import settings.

# --- Spec Kit ---
# .specify/ and specs/ are committed: they are the project's design record.

# --- Coding agent local settings (may contain personal paths or tokens) ---
.claude/settings.local.json
.env
.env.*

# --- Editors ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# --- OS ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.directory
.Trash-*/
